      "value": "I am unable to effectively test Avatar Performance Gated Group Instances due to this server-side bug. (Build 1820)\n\n- Max particles 1, one point light prefab, one particle system, max lights 1, reported as 1 light in a test build, but as 2 lights on the server.\n\n- Max particles 2, one point light prefab, one particle system, max lights 2, reported as 2 light in a test build, but as 3 lights on the server.",
