      "value": "Sample avatars (private) by me:\n\n- [Robot （1 particle light）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_46e780fa-79b8-4e40-ad6b-587fe9554d3e) `avtr_46e780fa-79b8-4e40-ad6b-587fe9554d3e`\n\n- [Robot （2 particle lights）](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_26b83617-f471-4010-9eb8-6cab9b244853) `avtr_26b83617-f471-4010-9eb8-6cab9b244853`",
